WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.316
"What do you mean?" Kip asked Seagull.

2
00:00:06.317 --> 00:00:10.652
"Bird loves pizza crust."

3
00:00:10.653 --> 00:00:14.077
"But Bird is sick," said Seagull.

4
00:00:14.078 --> 00:00:17.123
"You should bring her some noodle soup."

5
00:00:17.124 --> 00:00:20.397
"Noodle soup?" said Kip.

6
00:00:20.398 --> 00:00:43.168
"Yes," said Seagull. "Bird will like noodle soup."

7
00:00:43.169 --> 00:00:46.442
Kip saw Pigeon.

8
00:00:46.443 --> 00:00:49.158
"Bird is sick," said Kip.

9
00:00:49.159 --> 00:00:52.103
"I'm taking a pizza crust to her."

10
00:00:52.104 --> 00:00:54.922
"Really?" said Pigeon.

11
00:00:54.923 --> 00:00:59.006
"When I'm sick I don't like to eat.

12
00:00:59.007 --> 00:01:03.975
Why don't you bring her some warm blankets?"

13
00:01:03.976 --> 00:01:06.847
"Warm blankets?" said Kip.

14
00:01:06.848 --> 00:01:24.273
"Yes," said Pigeon. "Bird will like warm blankets."

15
00:01:24.274 --> 00:01:26.587
Kip saw Squirrel.

16
00:01:26.588 --> 00:01:29.867
"Bird is sick," said Kip.

17
00:01:29.868 --> 00:01:33.074
"I'm bringing her a pizza crust."

18
00:01:33.075 --> 00:01:36.902
"Bad idea!" said Squirrel.

19
00:01:36.903 --> 00:01:40.449
"Hot tea is much better."

20
00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:43.064
"Really?" asked Kip.

21
00:01:43.065 --> 00:01:49.157
"Yes," said Squirrel. "Bird will like hot tea."

22
00:01:49.158 --> 00:01:52.032
Kip was confused.

23
00:01:52.033 --> 00:01:54.767
He didn't know what to bring Bird.

24
00:01:54.768 --> 00:01:58.092
"Oh no!" cried Kip.

25
00:01:58.093 --> 00:02:07.274
"Now I feel awful too!"

